---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { socials } from '../config';

const interests = [
  'Empirical software engineering',
  'Game engine CI & build pipelines',
  'Automated crash triage & fault localization',
  'Identity architecture & ISO 27001',
  'Low-level graphics (Vulkan, OpenGL)',
  'Systems all the way down',
];
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Who I am, what I build, and what keeps me curious.">
  <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
  <div class="wayrule"></div>
  <h1 class="display h1">Hello.</h1>

  <p class="lede">I am Akil. I work as an IT Operations &amp; Cybersecurity Lead and ISO 27001 ISMS Officer, build software with modern AI tooling, and am pursuing research in software engineering with the long-term goal of earning a PhD.</p>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>By day, I lead IT operations and cybersecurity at Teams Squared, a global remote staffing firm placing skilled professionals worldwide. In addition to managing our identity architecture, endpoint security, and day-to-day IT systems, I serve as the appointed ISMS Officer driving our organization-wide ISO 27001 compliance. I genuinely enjoy this operational and security work – the discipline of building hardened, dependable environments and working directly with clients and their IT teams on access governance.</p>

    <p>Software engineering has been an avid interest of mine since high school. In recent years, incorporating next-generation AI developer tools like Claude Code and Google Antigravity has significantly accelerated what I can build and explore. On top of my IT and cybersecurity responsibilities, I actively design and develop internal platforms for Teams Squared, including our training LMS, hardware fleet tracker, and company client portal. Building production systems from the ground up gives me an intuitive, practical understanding of where architecture holds together and where it fails.</p>

    <p>That engineering foundation naturally feeds my curiosity for academic and applied research. I love researching, learning, uncovering new findings, and piecing together complex technical puzzles. I believe artificial intelligence and machine learning have the potential to profoundly supercharge the research process itself. By combining hands-on software development with deep fluency in AI tooling, I aim to create empirical frameworks, automated testing pipelines, and developer diagnostic tools that add meaningful, lasting value. I hold a Bachelor of Science in Computer Science from Dalhousie University (GPA 3.92, Sexton Scholar), and my long-term academic ambition is to pursue and complete a PhD.</p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="sec-label" id="looking">What I'm looking for</h2>
  <p class="seeking">I am open to opportunities across three connected paths: expanding my work in <strong>IT Operations &amp; Cybersecurity / ISO 27001 ISMS compliance</strong>, taking on <strong>software engineering and systems development</strong> roles, and joining <strong>research groups or academic labs</strong> to conduct empirical software engineering research toward a future PhD. I hold a Canadian post-graduation work permit (PGWP) valid through June 2029 and am open to relocation across Canada. If you are building dependable systems or researching developer tooling, I would love to connect.</p>

  <h2 class="sec-label">What keeps me curious</h2>
  <ul class="interests">
    {interests.map((i) => <li>{i}</li>)}
  </ul>

  <h2 class="sec-label">Elsewhere</h2>
  <ul class="contact">
    {socials.map((s) => (
      <li>
        <span class="c-label">{s.label}</span>
        <a href={s.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{s.handle ?? s.label}</a>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 3.4rem); margin-top: var(--space-1); }
  .lede {
    font-size: 1.0625rem; color: var(--ink-muted); line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 58ch; margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }
  .prose { max-width: var(--measure); margin-top: var(--space-3); }
  .prose p { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); color: var(--ink); }
  .seeking {
    max-width: var(--measure); margin-top: var(--space-2); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.6;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--cobalt); padding-left: var(--space-2);
  }
  .sec-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.6875rem; font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-muted);
    margin: var(--space-8) 0 var(--space-2);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-1);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    scroll-margin-top: 5rem;
  }
  .interests { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .interests li {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-muted);
    background: var(--paper-panel); padding: 5px 11px;
  }
  .contact { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-top: var(--space-2); max-width: 32rem; }
  .contact li {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 7rem 1fr; gap: var(--space-2);
    padding: var(--space-1) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8125rem; align-items: baseline;
  }
  .contact li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .c-label { color: var(--ink-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 0.6875rem; }
  .contact a { color: var(--cobalt); text-decoration: none; word-break: break-word; }
  .contact a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .contact li { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2px; }
  }
</style>
